# The Blacksmith of Mammon (RandomTeleport): he shouts one of his three lines as he appears
# (draw 1, sent as the NPC lines' NPCs spawn, before the first step), and half an hour
# later, then every half hour, moves to one of his six catacombs, drawing again while the
# draw is where he last moved to (the first catacomb before any move), then shouts a line
# where he arrives, out of the character's hearing (onCreated, onTimer). His first move
# draws the first catacomb twice, then the fourth, then his line; his second draws the
# fourth again, then the sixth, then his line. Every draw must be drawn, in order.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (RandomTeleport.java).
character Seeker 20
random 1 0 0 3 2 3 5 0
script script.ai.group.RandomTeleport
npc bom 31126 SignsPriest 100 0 0

advance 29m59s
advance 1s
advance 30m
